  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of sesame oil in a large hot pot vessel over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the shio-koji cure and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the beef broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the radish and cook for 5 minutes, or until slightly tender.",
    "Stir in the Korean chili flakes and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Sprinkle the shredded cheese over the top of the hot pot and cook until melted and slightly charred.",
    "Garnish with green onions, toasted sesame seeds, and a sprinkle of salt.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
